flowchart TD
    %% Employee Leave Request Process

    Start([Employee submits leave request]) --> ValidateDates{Dates valid?}

    ValidateDates -->|No| NotifyInvalid[Notify employee: invalid dates]
    NotifyInvalid --> End1([End])

    ValidateDates -->|Yes| CheckBalance{Sufficient balance?}

    CheckBalance -->|No| NotifyInsufficient[Notify employee: insufficient balance]
    NotifyInsufficient --> End2([End])

    CheckBalance -->|Yes| CheckOverlap{Team conflict?}

    CheckOverlap -->|Yes| NotifyConflict[Notify employee: team overlap]
    NotifyConflict --> ModifyOrCancel{Employee modifies?}
    ModifyOrCancel -->|Yes| Start
    ModifyOrCancel -->|No| End3([End])

    CheckOverlap -->|No| RouteApproval{Duration > 5 days?}

    RouteApproval -->|Yes| ManagerReview[Manager reviews request]
    RouteApproval -->|No| AutoApprove[Auto-approve]

    ManagerReview --> ManagerDecision{Approved?}
    ManagerDecision -->|Rejected| NotifyRejected[Notify employee: rejected with reason]
    NotifyRejected --> End4([End])

    ManagerDecision -->|Approved| ApproveRequest[Approve request]
    AutoApprove --> ApproveRequest

    ApproveRequest --> UpdateBalance[Deduct from leave balance]
    UpdateBalance --> NotifyTeam[Notify team calendar]
    NotifyTeam --> NotifyEmployee[Notify employee: confirmed]
    NotifyEmployee --> UpdatePayroll[Update payroll system]
    UpdatePayroll --> End5([End])

    %% Cancellation subprocess
    CancelStart([Employee cancels approved leave]) --> CancelCheck{Within cancellation window?}
    CancelCheck -->|Yes| RestoreBalance[Restore leave balance]
    RestoreBalance --> NotifyTeamCancel[Update team calendar]
    NotifyTeamCancel --> ConfirmCancel[Confirm cancellation]
    ConfirmCancel --> CancelEnd([End])

    CancelCheck -->|No| ManagerCancelReview[Manager reviews cancellation]
    ManagerCancelReview --> CancelDecision{Cancellation approved?}
    CancelDecision -->|Yes| RestoreBalance
    CancelDecision -->|No| DenyCancellation[Deny: leave stands]
    DenyCancellation --> CancelEnd
